```console
$ scherzo-cloud runner pool rename --help
Rename a Scherzo Cloud runner pool

Usage: scherzo-cloud runner pool rename [OPTIONS] --name <NAME> <ORGANIZATION> <POOL>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <POOL>          Runner pool ID or exact name

Options:
      --name <NAME>          Set the exact runner pool name
      --json                 Print the runner result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

```
